{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">How many <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">cups</span> are equivalent to <math alttext=\"83\"><mn>83</mn>\n</math> quarts? <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 4 cups  equals 1 quart right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>cups</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>quart</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math></p>", "keys": ["a2f8e0fb-4a78-424e-a214-dce42009de54"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "8e288e3d-2316-4258-931a-38415ae9c40d", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"21\"><mn>21</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "6aafb3bd-eb48-43ab-b5cc-5faf72de1d50", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"79\"><mn>79</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "55f93427-c821-48fe-ac53-4649c685fbb1", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"87\"><mn>87</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "a2f8e0fb-4a78-424e-a214-dce42009de54", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"332\"><mn>332</mn>\n</math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p>Choice D is correct. It's given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn></math> cups is equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn></math> quart. Multiplying&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction 4 cups Over 1 quart EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>cups</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>quart</mtext></mrow></mfrac></math> by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"83\"><mn>83</mn></math> quarts yields&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"4 dot 83\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>83</mn></math> cups, or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"332\"><mn>332</mn></math> cups.</p>\n<p>Choice A is incorrect. This is the number of quarts in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"83\"><mn>83</mn></math>&nbsp;cups, rounded to the nearest whole number.</p>\n<p>Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p>Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>", "externalid": "872cefa5-14e6-4009-b839-96c77f5f3579", "correct_answer": ["D"]}